[32m+[m[32m## How it works[m
 [m
[31m-- Members can create an account, log in, and submit their grades for a term[m
[31m-- The scholarship chair can view a table of all members and their grades[m
[31m-- The chair can filter that table by term, pledge class, GPA, and submission status[m
