[31m-- Invites, email reminders[m
[31m-- Transcript uploads / verification[m
[31m-- Deployment (runs locally only)[m
[31m-- Frontend polish (testing through FastAPI's `/docs` is fine at first)[m
[32m+[m[32m1. The chair sets up a **term**: first day, last day, and the weekly due day and time (e.g. Sundays at 11:59pm). Every week of the term is generated up front.[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Each member adds **their classes** for the term (course code, credits). They can add or drop classes at any time.[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Each week, the member enters a **current % for every class**. The app turns those into letter grades and a credit-weighted GPA using the house's grading scale.[m
[32m+[m[32m4. A submission made after the deadline still counts for the week it was due, but is marked **late**.[m
[32m+[m[32m5. Once a deadline passes, members who haven't submitted are marked **missing**.[m
[32m+[m[32m6. The chair decides which **flags** apply and what their thresholds are.[m
[32m+[m[32m7. Members can see their own history. The chair can see everyone's.[m
